#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:114
msgid ""
"**`http.port`** / **`http.tls.port`**：分别配置 HTTP 与 HTTPS 端口（默认 "
"2658 / 2659）。CLI `--port` 覆盖 `http.port`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:114
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**`auto: true`**（默认）：首次启动在 `~/.anima/tls/` 自动生成 cert/key（优"
#| "先 **mkcert**，否则 **openssl 自签**）；SAN 含 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、"
#| "`::1`、`http.host` 中的 bind 地址（跳过 `0.0.0.0`）及 "
#| "**`http.allowed_hosts`**。配置变更导致 SAN 不足时，**重启 Habitat 会自动删"
#| "除旧证书并重签**（`auto: false` 时仅告警，不覆盖手动证书）。"
msgid ""
"**`mode: mkcert`**（默认）：首次启动在 `~/.anima/tls/` 自动生成 cert/key（优"
"先 **mkcert**，否则 **openssl 自签**）；SAN 含 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、"
"`::1`、`http.host` 中的 bind 地址（跳过 `0.0.0.0`）及 "
"**`http.allowed_hosts`**。配置变更导致 SAN 不足时，**重启 Habitat 会自动删除"
"旧证书并重签**。"
msgstr ""
"**`auto: true`**（默认）：首次启动在 `~/.anima/tls/` 自动生成 cert/key（优先 "
"**mkcert**，否则 **openssl 自签**）；SAN 含 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、"
"`http.host` 中的 bind 地址（跳过 `0.0.0.0`）及 **`http.allowed_hosts`**。配置"
"变更导致 SAN 不足时，**重启 Habitat 会自动删除旧证书并重签**（`auto: false` "
"时仅告警，不覆盖手动证书）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:114
msgid ""
"**`mode: manual`**：须指定 `cert` / `key`（可选 `passphrase`）；不自动重签。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:114
msgid ""
"**探活**：`anima service status` 与 `GET /rpc/v1/health/probe` 仍走 HTTP（默"
"认 `:2658`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "可选：Let's Encrypt（公网域名）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:118
msgid ""
"有公网 IP、且域名 A/AAAA 指向本机时，可在 bootstrap 配置 ACME（**HTTP-01**，"
"默认监听 **:80**）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
"  tls:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    port: 2659\n"
"    mode: acme\n"
"    acme:\n"
"      email: you@example.com\n"
"      domains:\n"
"        - anima.example.com\n"
"      # challenge_port: 80\n"
"      # staging: false   # 调试时可 true（LE staging）\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:138
msgid ""
"证书写入 `~/.anima/tls/cert.pem` + `key.pem`（fullchain）；账号存 `~/.anima/"
"tls/acme-account.json`（0600）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:138
msgid ""
"启动时若证书覆盖 `domains` 且剩余有效期 **> 30 天** 则复用；否则签发/续期。进"
"程内约每 12h 检查，续期成功后重载 HTTPS `:2659`（HTTP `:2658` 与 challenge 服"
"不变）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:138
msgid ""
"Let's Encrypt **不签裸 IP**；客户端用 `https://<domain>:2659`（或自行反代到 "
"443）。公信 CA，**无需**安装 mkcert 根 CA。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:138
msgid ""
"`:80` 须公网可达（常见需 root / `CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE`，或确保端口未被占"
"用）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkcert root CA on clients (optional)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:142
msgid ""
"The Habitat server certificate lives on the Habitat host. Browsers, "
"**desktop shell**, and mobile APKs need the **mkcert root CA** "
"(`rootCA.pem`, not `cert.pem`) in the OS trust store for HTTPS `:2659` "
"without warnings（**Let's Encrypt 证书跳过本步**）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:145
msgid ""
"**设置 → 连接** (`/web/settings?section=habitat`): download **rootCA.pem** "
"and a **QR code** (QR points at the HTTP `:2658` download URL so you can "
"scan before trusting HTTPS)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:145
msgid ""
"If HTTPS pages still fail to load scripts, open settings via **`http://"
"<host>:2658/web/settings?section=habitat`** first."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:146
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkcert -CAROOT   # path to rootCA.pem on the Habitat host\n"
"mkcert -install  # trust that CA on the Habitat host itself\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:154
msgid ""
"**Desktop shell**: install `rootCA.pem` into the **OS** trust store (same "
"machine as the desktop app). Install the CA into the OS trust store so Tauri "
"WebView / system TLS trust Habitat HTTPS. On the Habitat host after `mkcert "
"-install`, no extra step is usually needed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:154
msgid ""
"**iOS**: AirDrop/email `rootCA.pem` → install the profile → **Settings → "
"General → About → Certificate Trust Settings** → enable full trust."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:154
msgid ""
"**Android**: optionally convert to DER, then **Settings → Security → Install "
"CA certificate**. Tauri Android builds also need a build that trusts user "
"CAs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:156
#, no-wrap
msgid "Daily LAN access: **HTTP `:2658`** or **HTTPS `:2659` (after CA trust for mkcert)**。公网域名 + `mode: acme`：`https://<domain>:2659`。仍可用反向代理或 VPN 做 harden。\n"
msgstr ""

